# Source material kept on the working machine but out of the deploy. None of these are referenced
# by src/ — they are earlier portraits, superseded resumes, project logos and spare screenshots
# that may get used in a later pass. Untracked rather than deleted so they stay to hand locally;
# every one of them is still recoverable from history (`git log --all -- <path>`) if a fresh clone
# ever needs them back.
public/portrait.png
public/portrait-Photoroom.png
public/pk_portrait.png
public/pomelli-image.png
public/CV1.pdf
public/images/hero-image.png
public/images/NYJETS_1.webp
public/projects_assets/HomeDoc/logo.png
public/projects_assets/LucidTone/logo.svg
public/projects_assets/NILINK/logo.png
public/projects_assets/RAG/logo.png
